{# steps/ReReference.j2 #}

{% set ref = s.settings.ref_channels %}
{% set projection = s.settings.projection %}
{% set ch_type = s.settings.resolved_ch_type %}
{% set joint = s.settings.joint %}

{# Human-readable channel-type labels #}
{% set type_labels = {
    'eeg': 'EEG',
    'ecog': 'ECoG',
    'seeg': 'sEEG',
    'dbs': 'DBS'
} %}

{% if ch_type is sequence and ch_type is not string %}
    {% set ns = namespace(labels=[]) %}
    {% for ct in ch_type %}
        {% set _ = ns.labels.append(type_labels.get(ct, ct)) %}
    {% endfor %}
    {% set channel_label = ns.labels | join(' and ') %}
{% else %}
    {% set channel_label = type_labels.get(ch_type, ch_type) %}
{% endif %}

#### ReReferencing

{% if ref == 'average' %}

    {% if projection %}
An average-reference projection was added to the {{ channel_label }} data but was not applied at this stage.
    {% elif ch_type is sequence and ch_type is not string and not joint %}
The {{ channel_label }} data were re-referenced separately within each channel type to the average of all clean channels of that type.
    {% elif ch_type is sequence and ch_type is not string and joint %}
The {{ channel_label }} data were jointly re-referenced to the average of all clean channels across the selected channel types.
    {% else %}
The {{ channel_label }} data were re-referenced to the average of all clean {{ channel_label }} channels.
    {% endif %}

{% elif ref == 'REST' %}

The {{ channel_label }} data were re-referenced to infinity using the Reference Electrode Standardization Technique (REST) and a forward model
({{ ref('Yao2001', 'Yao, D. (2001). A method to standardize a reference of scalp EEG recordings to a point at infinity. Physiological Measurement, 22(4), 693–711. doi:10.1088/0967-3334/22/4/305') }}).
{% elif ref is mapping %}

The {{ channel_label }} data were re-referenced using channel-specific reference mappings.

{% elif ref is sequence and ref is not string %}

    {% if ref | length == 0 %}
No re-referencing was applied to the {{ channel_label }} data.
    {% elif ref | length == 1 %}
The {{ channel_label }} data were re-referenced to channel {{ ref[0] }}.
    {% else %}
The {{ channel_label }} data were re-referenced to the average of channels {{ ref | join(', ') }}.
    {% endif %}

{% elif ref is not none %}

The {{ channel_label }} data were re-referenced to channel {{ ref }}.

{% endif %}